# Direct dependencies with intended version constraints.
#
# Compile to requirements.txt with:
#   pip-compile requirements.in
#
# To deliberately upgrade a version, edit the constraint here (or bump the
# exact pin) and recompile with:
#   pip-compile --upgrade requirements.in
#
# Never hand-edit requirements.txt or `pip install` a newer version without
# updating this file first -- see AGENTS.md "Local development".

# Loads .env / .env.local into os.environ -- see config/settings.py and
# AGENTS.md "Local development".
